rs and startups in the DACH region. Web design, development and maintenance from Berlin — measurably better.\",\"url\":\"https://surhay.design\",\"email\":\"hallo@surhay.design\",\"image\":\"https://surhay.design/og-default.png\",\"priceRange\":\"€€\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Berlin\",\"addressCountry\":\"DE\"},\"areaServed\":[\"DE\",\"AT\",\"CH\"],\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/surhay-design\",\"https://www.instagram.com/surhay.design\",\"https://github.com/surhay\"],\"knowsAbout\":[\"Webdesign\",\"Webentwicklung\",\"SEO\",\"Website-Wartung\"]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$e"}}],"$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13"],"$L14"]
