 — after the free consultation you receive a fixed-price quote with no hidden costs. What the quote says is what you pay.</p>"}}]}]]}],["$","div","Why does a website cost more than a site-builder subscription?",{"className":"faq-item","style":{"--i":"1"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"faq-head","children":["$","button",null,{"type":"button","id":"faq-preise-1-q","className":"faq-trigger flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display font-semibold tracking-tight py-5 text-[1.05rem] md:text-lg","aria-expanded":"false","aria-controls":"faq-preise-1-p","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[false,["$","span",null,{"children":"Why does a website cost more than a site-builder subscription?"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-glyph","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-bar faq-bar-v"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-bar faq-bar-h"}]]}]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"faq-panel","id":"faq-preise-1-p","role":"region","aria-labelledby":"faq-preise-1-q","suppressHydrationWarning":true,"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"faq-panel-inner prose max-w-none pb-6 pr-14 text-mute","style":{"fontSize":"0.96rem"},"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Because you are buying two different things. In a site builder you rent a template and assemble it yourself — your time is the real price there. With us you get structure, a copy framework, design and build as a finished result that belongs to you afterwards. If your offer is simple and you enjoy doing it yourself, a site builder is the more sensible choice — and we say so in the first call.</p>"}}]}]]}],["$","div","What costs remain after launch?",{"className":"faq-item","style":{"--i":"2"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"faq-head","children":["$","button",null,{"type":"button","id":"faq-preise-2-q","className":"faq-trigger flex w-full cu