eck-ins in between. If you happen to be in Berlin though, we’re happy to meet in person — espresso is on us.</p>"}}]}]]}],["$","div","Who do I work with during the project?",{"className":"faq-item","style":{"--i":"1"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"faq-head","children":["$","button",null,{"type":"button","id":"faq-zusammenarbeit-1-q","className":"faq-trigger flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display font-semibold tracking-tight py-5 text-[1.05rem] md:text-lg","aria-expanded":"false","aria-controls":"faq-zusammenarbeit-1-p","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[false,["$","span",null,{"children":"Who do I work with during the project?"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-glyph","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-bar faq-bar-v"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-bar faq-bar-h"}]]}]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"faq-panel","id":"faq-zusammenarbeit-1-p","role":"region","aria-labelledby":"faq-zusammenarbeit-1-q","suppressHydrationWarning":true,"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"faq-panel-inner prose max-w-none pb-6 pr-14 text-mute","style":{"fontSize":"0.96rem"},"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>With one person, from the first call until after launch. No account management sitting between you and the work, and no handover to another team once the project is running. You get a reply to any request within 24 hours, usually faster on working days.</p>"}}]}]]}],["$","div","What happens in the first call — and does it cost anything?",{"className":"faq-item","style":{"--i":"2"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"faq-head","children":["$","button",null,{"type":"button","id":"faq-zusammenarbeit-2-q","className":"faq-trigger flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display font-semibold tracking-tight py-5 text-[1.05rem] md:text-lg","a