es and a far smaller attack surface than a classic database install. The full stack is listed openly on the studio page — your IT team should know what they are getting.</p>"}}]}]]}],["$","div","Do you work with WordPress?",{"className":"faq-item","style":{"--i":"1"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"faq-head","children":["$","button",null,{"type":"button","id":"faq-technik-1-q","className":"faq-trigger flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display font-semibold tracking-tight py-5 text-[1.05rem] md:text-lg","aria-expanded":"false","aria-controls":"faq-technik-1-p","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[false,["$","span",null,{"children":"Do you work with WordPress?"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-glyph","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-bar faq-bar-v"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-bar faq-bar-h"}]]}]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"faq-panel","id":"faq-technik-1-p","role":"region","aria-labelledby":"faq-technik-1-q","suppressHydrationWarning":true,"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"faq-panel-inner prose max-w-none pb-6 pr-14 text-mute","style":{"fontSize":"0.96rem"},"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>New projects are deliberately built without WordPress and without bought themes. Not out of ideology, but arithmetic: a theme with thirty plugins is cheaper in month one and more expensive from year two — in load time, in security holes and in effort. If your organisation specifically needs WordPress, we say so in the first call and point you to someone. Neglected installs that have not seen an update in years, we do not take over.</p>"}}]}]]}],["$","div","Where does the website run — and who owns it?",{"className":"faq-item","style":{"--i":"2"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"faq-head","children":["$","button",null,{"type":"button","id":"faq-technik-2-q","className":"faq-trigger flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display font-semibold tracking-tight py-5 text-[1.05rem] md:text-lg","aria-expanded":"false","aria-controls":"faq-technik-2-p","children":["$L4a","$L4b"]}]}],"$L4c"]}],"$L4d"],"$L4e"],"data-c-faq-page":""}]],"data-c-faq-page":""}]
