ery project with a personal walkthrough.</p>"}}]}]]}],["$","div","Do I really need a maintenance plan?",{"className":"faq-item","style":{"--i":"1"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"faq-head","children":["$","button",null,{"type":"button","id":"faq-pflege-1-q","className":"faq-trigger flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display font-semibold tracking-tight py-5 text-[1.05rem] md:text-lg","aria-expanded":"false","aria-controls":"faq-pflege-1-p","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[false,["$","span",null,{"children":"Do I really need a maintenance plan?"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-glyph","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-bar faq-bar-v"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-bar faq-bar-h"}]]}]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"faq-panel","id":"faq-pflege-1-p","role":"region","aria-labelledby":"faq-pflege-1-q","suppressHydrationWarning":true,"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"faq-panel-inner prose max-w-none pb-6 pr-14 text-mute","style":{"fontSize":"0.96rem"},"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>It’s not mandatory. But even the best website needs updates, backups and a watchful eye — otherwise it becomes slow, insecure or goes down over time. A maintenance plan covers all of that, cancelable monthly. Alternatively, we hand the website over completely — no agency lock-in.</p>"}}]}]]}],["$","div","Can you handle content updates for me?",{"className":"faq-item","style":{"--i":"2"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"faq-head","children":["$","button",null,{"type":"button","id":"faq-pflege-2-q","className":"faq-trigger flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display font-semibold tracking-tight py-5 text-[1.05rem] md:text-lg","aria-expanded":"false","aria-controls":"faq-pflege-2-p","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[false,["$","span",null,{"children":"Can you handle content updates for me?"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":"$L4f"}]]}]}],"$L50"]}],"$L51"],"$L52"],"data-c-faq-page":""}]],"data-c-faq-page":""}]
