terprises providing services. We build to WCAG 2.2 AA as the target regardless — keyboard operation, measured contrast, semantic HTML. Whether the obligation applies to you is a legal question, and that needs someone licensed to advise.</p>"}}]}]]}],["$","div","Do you take care of the imprint, privacy policy and cookie banner?",{"className":"faq-item","style":{"--i":"1"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"faq-head","children":["$","button",null,{"type":"button","id":"faq-recht-1-q","className":"faq-trigger flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display font-semibold tracking-tight py-5 text-[1.05rem] md:text-lg","aria-expanded":"false","aria-controls":"faq-recht-1-p","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[false,["$","span",null,{"children":"Do you take care of the imprint, privacy policy and cookie banner?"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-glyph","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-bar faq-bar-v"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"faq-bar faq-bar-h"}]]}]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"faq-panel","id":"faq-recht-1-p","role":"region","aria-labelledby":"faq-recht-1-q","suppressHydrationWarning":true,"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"faq-panel-inner prose max-w-none pb-6 pr-14 text-mute","style":{"fontSize":"0.96rem"},"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>We set the imprint and privacy pages up technically and put them in place; the wording comes from you, your lawyer or a generator — we are not allowed to give legal advice. A cookie banner is usually unnecessary on our projects because no tracking is built in by default. If an analytics tool is added later, we add consent and the privacy wording together.</p>"}}]}]]}],["$","div","Who owns the images, copy and code?",{"className":"faq-item","style":{"--i":"2"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"faq-head","children":["$","butto